| **Application** | **False Positive** | **False Negative** |
|------------------|--------------------------|--------------------------| 
| **Supermarket** | ![](assets/emoji/check_mark.png){ width=20px } Minor issue | ![](assets/emoji/warning.png){ width=20px } Costly |
